bb-plugin-stelow ships vendored copies of two files from the upstream Stelow
repository (https://github.com/calionauta/stelow):

- data/stelow (from scripts/stelow at upstream) — the stage transition helper.
  License: same as upstream Stelow (MIT).
- references/transitions.md — the stage transitions table.

These files are upstream by the Stelow authors; bb-plugin-stelow embeds them so
that a fresh project can advance stages without first installing the Stelow
skill. If you change Stelow's transitions.md upstream, mirror the change here.
